WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
The news said it will be logged in in a few hours.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I'm going over now

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,930
Is it too late?

4
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:08,930
You immediately ask Wang Hongqi to take you to the military airport

5
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:10,930
The whole country gives you the green light

6
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:11,930
I'm not in Jinling

7
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:12,930
But I will go to Nanzhou

8
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:14,930
meet you
